    "de": [
      "Ob Erwachsener oder Kind, lassen Sie Ihrer Kreativität in unseren Workshops für kreative Freizeitgestaltung freien Lauf (Serviettage, Scapbooking, Carterie, ...)."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Whether you're an adult or a child, come and express your creativity in our creative hobby workshops (servietting, scapbooking, cardmaking, etc.)."
    ],
